<title>USA: CCC says sells 5.31 mln bushels wheat from catalog.</title>
<headline>CCC says sells 5.31 mln bushels wheat from catalog.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department</p>
<p>of Agriculture said it sold a total of 5,311,803 bushels of wheat at this</p>
<p>week's catalog sale. It had offered 10.45 million bushels for sale.</p>
